  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Myanmar Earthquake Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will provide multi-sectoral assistance in Mandalay and Sagaing, focusing on health, WASH, protection, and cash assistance to support the survival, safety, and dignity of earthquake-affected people. Through partner-led and direct programming, the DEC-funded project will target the needs of marginalised populations, including women, children, and persons with disabilities. The Phase-1 runs from April 3rd 2025 to September 30th 2025. Phase-2 will run from October 1st 2025 to March 31 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
